<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Pay2View Video Upload is Here!</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f5f5f5; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:20px 0;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #dddddd; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
            
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" bgcolor="#000000" style="color:#ffffff; padding:30px; font-size:24px; font-weight:bold;">
                🎬 The Wait is Over! Video Uploads Are Here!
              </td>
            </tr>
            
            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;">
                
                <p style="margin-top:0; font-size:16px;">
                  Hi {{name}},  
                  Exciting news! You can now upload videos on Pay2View and start earning more from your content.
                </p>

                <ul style="padding-left:18px; margin:15px 0; font-size:15px;">
                  <li>Upload **up to 3 videos** per month, each **10 to 60 seconds long**.</li>
                  <li>All videos are fully **encrypted** for security and peace of mind.</li>
                  <li>We take a **20% fee** from video sales due to storage and streaming costs.</li>
                  <li>Share trending or highly-demanded videos — people want to watch, and you earn!</li>
                  <li>Use your creativity: tutorials, tips, exclusive clips, or trending challenges.</li>
                  <li>Promote your Pay2View link on social media to reach more viewers and maximize earnings.</li>
                </ul>

                <p style="margin-top:20px; font-size:15px;">
                  Ready to make money? Start uploading your first video now and see your earnings grow!
                </p>

                <p style="margin-top:10px; font-size:15px;">
                  🚀 Happy creating and earning with Pay2View!
                </p>

              </td>
            </tr>
            
            <!-- Call-to-Action Button -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:20px;">
                <a href="{{upload_link}}" style="background-color:#000; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 25px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:bold; display:inline-block;">
                  Upload Your Video Now
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" bgcolor="#f5f5f5" style="color:#888888; font-size:12px; padding:15px;">
                &copy;  Pay2View. All rights reserved.
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
